From 653ff58ffba5b13db10a9ba543ee445ad9a226f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:45:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] CI: run crawler security guards on Python 3.13 (pinned
 requirements need >=3.12, e.g. networkx==3.7)

Run 45028067283 failed at dependency install on Python 3.11 before any test ran.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U1on2TzucdKCNmpKvBZK7J
(cherry picked from commit feec010375bc029d82569552651cb35124c78841)
---
 .github/workflows/crawler-security-ci.yml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/crawler-security-ci.yml b/.github/workflows/crawler-security-ci.yml
index 5f0b941d..5f89f04d 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/crawler-security-ci.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/crawler-security-ci.yml
@@ -21,7 +21,7 @@ jobs:
       - uses: actions/checkout@v4
       - uses: actions/setup-python@v5
         with:
-          python-version: "3.11"
+          python-version: "3.13"
       - name: Install pinned dependencies
         run: pip install -r requirements.txt pytest
       - name: Blocked host must not appear outside blocked_hosts
